  "description": "Ray Cooke Lettings are delighted to present this stunning 2-bedroom / 2-bathroom apartment to the rental market, ideally situated within the highly sought-after and well-maintained development of Eaton Close, Rathcoole.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, with an excellent selection of local amenities just a short stroll away, including shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and leisure facilities. Eaton Close enjoys exceptional connectivity, with reliable public transport services and easy access to major road networks, making commuting to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas both convenient and efficient.\r\n\r\nThis bright, spacious, and beautifully presented apartment is offered in turnkey condition and has been meticulously maintained. The accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with ample storage, a large open-plan living and dining area, and a fully fitted modern kitchen complete with integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nThere are two generously sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a stylish main family bathroom, both finished to a high standard. The property further benefits from quality fixtures and fittings throughout, providing comfortable and contemporary living in a peaceful residential setting.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n• 2 spacious bedrooms\r\n• 2 bathrooms\r\n• Presented in excellent condition throughout\r\n• Available furnished or unfurnished\r\n• Large open-plan living / dining area\r\n• Fully fitted modern kitchen\r\n• Integrated appliances\r\n• High-quality flooring, fixtures and fittings\r\n• Gas-fired central heating\r\n• Ample storage throughout\r\n• Bright and airy living spaces\r\n• Secure and well-maintained development\r\n• Private parking available\r\n• Peaceful location with excellent transport links\r\n• All local amenities within a short stroll\r\n• Ideal for a wide range of tenants\r\n\r\nEmail enquires only please | No phone calls",
